# SwiftUI View Patterns

## Before Creating New Components

Check `step/Views/SharedViews/` for existing components:

**Buttons**: `PrimaryButton`, `SecondaryButton`, `DestructiveTextButton`, `HeaderIconButton`, `VideoControlButton`, `VideoPrimaryButton`, `VideoTextButton`, `VideoActionButton`

**Cards**: `VideoCardView`, `ProgramCardView`, `CoachCardView`, `LiveClassCardView`, `TopPicksCardView`, `ActivityConfirmationCard`, `SmallClassCard`

**Loading**: `AnimatedSpinner` (full screen), `ShimmerModifier` (skeleton), `AnimatedDots` (text/AI), `LoadingIndicator`

**Inputs**: `UnifiedPhoneEmailField`, `ChatInputBar`

**Badges**: `PillarBadge`, `DurationBadge`, `IntensityTag`

**Other**: `CategoryView`, `SubCategoryView`, `MuscleGroupView`, `NoInternetView`, `OfflineBannerView`, `GuestModeOverlay`, `FloatingTabBar`

## Navigation Pattern

```swift
.navigationBarTitleDisplayMode(.inline)
.navigationBarBackButtonHidden(true)
.toolbar {
    ToolbarItem(placement: .navigationBarLeading) {
        HeaderIconButton(icon: .back) { dismiss() }
    }
}
```

## Screen States — Every Screen Must Handle

1. **Content** — Normal data display
2. **Loading** — Shimmer skeletons (lists/grids), `AnimatedSpinner` (full screen), `AnimatedDots` (text/AI)
3. **Empty** — Icon (64pt, 40% opacity) + title + description + CTA button
4. **Error** — Use `ErrorService.shared`
5. **Offline** — `OfflineBannerView` or `NoInternetView`

## Background Modifiers

| Modifier | Usage |
|---|---|
| `.appBackground()` | Main app screens (gradient + blurred pillar blobs) |
| `.sheetBackground()` | Bottom sheets (solid color) |
| `.background(.ultraThinMaterial)` | Glass effect for elevated surfaces |

## Section Header Hierarchy

| Tier | Token | Style | Usage |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Primary** | `title` / `titleSmall` | 20-24pt sentence case | Top-level sections |
| **Structural** | `overline` | 11pt UPPERCASE `textSecondary` | Sub-section markers in detail views |

Never mix tiers.

## Hero Image (Detail Screens)

Use for `VideoDetailView`, `ProgramDetailView`, `CoachDetailView`, `LiveClassDetailView`:
- Height: `DesignTokens.HeroImage.height` (320pt)
- Aspect: 16:9 fill
- Overlay: 4-stop gradient (black@30% → clear → clear → background@60%)
- Bottom corners: rounded `DesignTokens.HeroImage.bottomCornerRadius` (20pt)

## Frozen Pane / Section Header

Edge-to-edge structural divider (no corner radius):
```swift
VStack(spacing: 0) {
    Divider().opacity(0.3)
    HStack {
        Text("SECTION TITLE")
            .scaledFont(DesignTokens.Typography.overline)
            .foregroundColor(Color.AppColors.textSecondary)
        Spacer()
    }
    .padding(.horizontal, DesignTokens.Layout.pageMargin)
    .padding(.vertical, DesignTokens.Spacing.md)
    .background(Color.AppColors.chaptersBackground)
    Divider().opacity(0.3)
}
```

## Haptic Feedback

| Action | Feedback |
|---|---|
| Primary tap (button, card) | Medium |
| Secondary tap (cancel, back) | Light |
| Destructive (delete, logout) | Heavy |
| Success (completion) | Success |
| Error (form failure) | Error |
